{"number":104,"name":"سُورَةُ الهُمَزَةِ","englishName":"Al-Humaza","englishNameTranslation":"The Traducer","numberOfAyahs":9,"items":[{"id":"q:104:1","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":104,"ayah":1,"surahName":"Al-Humaza","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَيْلٌۭ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍۢ لُّمَزَةٍ","en":"Woe to every scorner and mocker","bn":"প্রত্যেক পশ্চাতে ও সম্মুখে পরনিন্দাকারীর দুর্ভোগ,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/104/1"},{"id":"q:104:2","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":104,"ayah":2,"surahName":"Al-Humaza","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ٱلَّذِى جَمَعَ مَالًۭا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","en":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it.","bn":"যে অর্থ সঞ্চিত করে ও গণনা করে","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/104/2"},{"id":"q:104:3","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":104,"ayah":3,"surahName":"Al-Humaza","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"يَحْسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخْلَدَهُۥ","en":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal.","bn":"সে মনে করে যে, তার অর্থ চিরকাল তার সাথে থাকবে!","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/104/3"},{"id":"q:104:4","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":104,"ayah":4,"surahName":"Al-Humaza","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"كَلَّا ۖ لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِى ٱلْحُطَمَةِ","en":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher.","bn":"কখনও না, সে অবশ্যই নিক্ষিপ্ত হবে পিষ্টকারীর মধ্যে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/104/4"},{"id":"q:104:5","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":104,"ayah":5,"surahName":"Al-Humaza","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْحُطَمَةُ","en":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher?","bn":"আপনি কি জানেন, পিষ্টকারী কি?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/104/5"},{"id":"q:104:6","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":104,"ayah":6,"surahName":"Al-Humaza","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"نَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلْمُوقَدَةُ","en":"It is the fire of Allah, [eternally] fueled,","bn":"এটা আল্লাহর প্রজ্জ্বলিত অগ্নি,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/104/6"},{"id":"q:104:7","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":104,"ayah":7,"surahName":"Al-Humaza","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ٱلَّتِى تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلْأَفْـِٔدَةِ","en":"Which mounts directed at the hearts.","bn":"যা হৃদয় পর্যন্ত পৌছবে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/104/7"},{"id":"q:104:8","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":104,"ayah":8,"surahName":"Al-Humaza","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِنَّهَا عَلَيْهِم مُّؤْصَدَةٌۭ","en":"Indeed, Hellfire will be closed down upon them","bn":"এতে তাদেরকে বেঁধে দেয়া হবে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/104/8"},{"id":"q:104:9","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":104,"ayah":9,"surahName":"Al-Humaza","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فِى عَمَدٍۢ مُّمَدَّدَةٍۭ","en":"In extended columns.","bn":"লম্বা লম্বা খুঁটিতে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/104/9"}]}